	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8ac2a8b4ecb59205","type":"text","text":"**[Hash Function](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Hash%20Function.md)**\nFungsi yang menghasilkan angka numerik untuk menghasilkan indeks lokasi penyimpanan pada *hash table*.\n","x":-546,"y":236,"width":326,"height":144},
		{"id":"42c783eab7149024","type":"text","text":"**[Bucket Array](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Bucket%20Array.md)**\nArray yang telah disiapkan untuk menampung *hash code* dan juga *value* dari data.","x":-169,"y":236,"width":309,"height":144},
		{"id":"473fbefa57319229","type":"text","text":"**[Load Factor](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Load%20Factor.md)**\nMetrik yang digunakan untuk mengetahui seberapa penuh slot yang tersedia pada *bucket array* ","x":200,"y":236,"width":280,"height":144},
		{"id":"40f5d0c1a8307c8e","type":"text","text":"**[Key dan Value](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Key%20dan%20Value.md)**\n_key_ dan _value_ merupakan pasangan data yang tidak terpisahkan, yang sering disebut sebagai _key-value pair_.","x":400,"y":-30,"width":280,"height":160},
		{"id":"00345bc5f401b64b","type":"text","text":" **[Collision](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision.md)**\n Kondisi ketika *hash function* menghasilkan *hash code* yang sama untuk 2 *key* yang berbeda. Sebuah konsekuensi logis dari keterbatasan ruang memori yang membutuhkan penanganan khusus.","x":-720,"y":-119,"width":407,"height":178},
		{"id":"43c652dba6049c1d","type":"text","text":"[Chaining](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Chaining.md)","x":-1120,"y":-245,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"268796968b9252f0","type":"text","text":"[Robin Hood Hashing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Robin%20Hood%20Hashing.md)","x":-1120,"y":135,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5990b8413767123d","type":"text","text":"[Coalesced Hashing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Coalesced%20Hashing.md)","x":-1120,"y":-169,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"301fc757b955e959","type":"text","text":"[Cuckoo Hashing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Cuckoo%20Hashing.md)","x":-1120,"y":-93,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8d6796d156d65afb","type":"text","text":"[Open Addresing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Open%20Addresing.md)","x":-1120,"y":-17,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ac67c15d89b721af","type":"text","text":"[Perfect Hashing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Collision%20Resolution/Perfect%20Hashing.md)","x":-1120,"y":59,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b3bcee71c200b97e","type":"text","text":"**[Resizing dan Rehashing](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Resizing%20dan%20Rehashing.md)**\nProses fundamental untuk menjaga efisiensi _hash table_ agar tetap berjalan dalam waktu rata-rata seiring bertambahnya jumlah elemen. Proses ini merupakan mekanisme pertahanan utama terhadap penurunan performa yang disebabkan oleh peningkatan _load factor_.","x":200,"y":-480,"width":455,"height":203},
		{"id":"31e79060b9ef8c5f","type":"text","text":"# Hash Table\n","x":-154,"y":-70,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"9b53bb3404012be2","type":"text","text":"**[Struktur data untuk Bucket Array](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Implementation/Struktur%20data%20untuk%20Bucket%20Array.md)**\n\nGunakan struktur data array yang dinamis, seperti `vector` di C++. \n\n","x":-14,"y":680,"width":309,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0156b09940f63ceb","type":"text","text":" **[Bucket Array Size](04-Data%20Structure/Foundation%20-%20Hash%20Table/Implementation/Bucket%20Array%20Size.md)**\n \n Menentukan ukuran default dari *bucket array* ternyata ada aturan tertentu, dan ini berkaitan dengan performa *hash table*.","x":-420,"y":680,"width":360,"height":160,"color":"1"},
